@startuml
title Trinh tu xac nhan da uong thuoc
autonumber
actor "Nguoi cao tuoi" as User
participant "Web React / M02" as Web
participant "Express API" as API
participant "authMiddleware" as Auth
participant "Dose service / model" as Dose
database "MongoDB" as DB
User -> Web: Nhan nut Da uong thuoc
Web -> API: POST /api/v1/doses/{id}/confirm + clientRequestId
API -> Auth: Xac minh Firebase ID token
Auth --> API: UID nguoi dung
API -> Dose: Kiem tra chu ho so va trang thai
Dose -> DB: Cap nhat lan uong theo dieu kien trang thai
alt Cung clientRequestId da xu ly truoc do
 DB --> Dose: Tra ket qua da luu
 Dose --> API: Ket qua idempotent
else Lan uong hop le
 DB --> Dose: Lan uong da cap nhat
 Dose --> API: Trang thai confirmed
else Khong co quyen hoac trang thai khong hop le
 Dose --> API: Loi 403 / 404 / 409
end
API --> Web: JSON thanh cong hoac loi
Web --> User: Cap nhat trang thai va thong ke
@enduml
